{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/close()"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Deterministic shutdown (CONTRACT.md §18)."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"close"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Releases the HTTP client and its connection pool, and clears the cookie jar, the CSRF token","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and any retained ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive","isActive":true},{"text":" challenge token (§18.1 rule 6).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Idempotent","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (rule 2): calling it twice is a no-op the second time. Cleanup code runs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from error paths, and an error path that itself throws hides the original failure."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Does not log out","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" (rule 5): it issues no request. The server-side session deliberately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"outlives the client object — that is what lets a process restart and resume — so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"close()"},{"type":"text","text":" that logged out would silently end every user’s session on each deploy."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use after close is an error, not undefined"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" (rule 4): every operation afterwards"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/NetworkError","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" naming the cause rather than silently reopening."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"deinit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" cannot ","type":"text"},{"code":"await","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and releasing an ","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncHTTPClient","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is async, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this SDK cannot make deallocation a complete shutdown the way §18.1 rule 1’s “a ","type":"text"},{"code":"deinit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"plus explicit ","type":"text"},{"code":"close()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"” suggests. ","type":"text"},{"code":"close()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is therefore the only complete form, and is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stated as required rather than implied.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/close()"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC5closeyyYaKF","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"title":"close()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"close","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"